+    type: conditional
+    size: 1
+    doc: Presence indicates that the packe includes a constant tone extension
+                
+  AdvDataInfo:
+    type: conditional
+    size: 2
+    doc: ADI can be set to distinguish between different advertising sets by this device
+
+  AuxPtr:
+    type: conditional
+    size: 3
+    doc: Presence indicates that some or all of the advertisment data is in the subsequent auxillary packet
+
+  # TODO
+  SyncInfo:
